      "writtenOn": "2021-03-09T20:55:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the logic of this function is getting harder to follow:\n* There are multiple places where we convert from TBT speed to USB speed using similar logic, and I think there should be a helper function to do this (analogous to the USB-to-TBT function added in an earlier CL).\n* On line 973, we\u0027re converting from TBT speed to USB speed, but the TBT speed came from get_tbt_cable_speed, which, per the previous CL in the chain, may actually have been converted from a USB4 speed in the Passive Cable VDO.\n\nIs there a more straightforward way to do this?",
      "revId": "bfa4a8b35f4006cd8545c8428eb70a2402ab665d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
